Real Knife was added in '''Beta 52.1''' as a Generated card from Chara's reworked '''Genocide''' [[Artifacts#Genocide|Artifact]]. It allowed the user to Silence and kill any monster on the board for 3G. But this came at the cost of reducing your max HP in a similar way as Fatigue. '''Beta 55.1''' nerfed it by no longer being able to Silence before killing nor able to target ally monsters.

=== Stats ===
Main spell giver: Chara

Cost: 3

Effects:

* Increase the Genocide counter by 1. Reduce your max HP by the counter.
** Silence and kill a monster. (Post Beta 52.1)
** Kill an enemy monster. (Post Beta 55.1, Current)

Rarity: Green (Generated)
